~ day_start
Mum: We're nearly there! Just [color=firebrick]one[/color] more day to go.
Kid: Yay! This has been fun, but I'm excited to see [color=purple]Grandma.[/color]
Mum: Me too. How's your racing game going?
Kid: Pretty good, but it's harder to play by the ocean! Bird poo keeps getting on the window — [color=firebrick]YUCK![/color]


do game.begin_game()

=> END


~ day_end
Mum: Oh look, the [color=goldenrod]sun[/color] is out!
Kid: ... are we there yet?
Mum: [color=goldenrod]Yes we are![/color]
Kid: [wave]Yay! Finally![/wave]

do game.end_day()

=> END